## How to start

- **Find a cause.** If you don't have one, [Catchafire](https://www.catchafire.org/ "Catchafire — Skills-Based Volunteering") and [Taproot](https://taprootfoundation.org/ "Taproot Foundation — Pro Bono Service") match skilled volunteers with nonprofits.
- **Ask what they pay for every month.** The first project is usually hiding in that list.
- **Pick one gap, and ship it.** One Worker, one fewer bill. Earn trust before you touch the donor database.
- **Write the rules down before the agent writes code.** Start a `CLAUDE.md` on day one, and add the *why* every time something breaks.
- **Make staff the testers.** They know what right looks like. You and the agent don't.

